    <avalancheActivity>
      <highlights>The Avalanche Warning Service currently has only a small amount of information that has been collected in the field. &lt;br/> The danger of natural avalanches will decrease gradually.</highlights>
      <comment>In particular from starting zones at higher altitudes large natural avalanches, capable of reaching the valleys, must be expected. Above approximately 2300 m they can be released in the new snow and wind slab layers. &lt;br/> The wind slabs will be deposited on unfavourable layers. They are to be assessed with care and prudence. &lt;br/> Single backcountry tourers can release avalanches.</comment>
    </avalancheActivity>
